''11/04/22 Green: This quest is currently bugged.  Giving Vacto any valid combination will randomly give one of the three rewards.  On my first attempt, I gave him the two scarab carapaces and 5 gold for a helm and was awarded the boots.  On the second attempt, gave him two scarab carapaces and 5 gold and properly received the helm.  On the third attempt, gave him one Pristine and the 23 gold and he gave me another helm.  As a test, I once again gave him the two scarab carapaces and 5 gold and received the breastplate.''


''12/5/2022 Green: I did about 10 turn ins all gave correct armor.  If someone has recently given the scarab piece without the Money the next full turn in will give the incorrect armor piece.  This can be fixed by giving gold to Vacto.  He will then hand over the correct armor piece.  

